    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just really hate how antibiotics mess up my stomach and everything. my friend told me that if you take like 3000mg of oregano oil a day it works just as well as the meds for most people. do u think it's safe to try doing that for a few days to see if it works before i go through the hassle of an appointment?",
