      "content": "Taking 3000mg of oregano oil daily is generally risky and not typically safe without medical supervision, as high doses can severely damage the stomach lining and interact with many medications. Since you are already experiencing pressure and burning, this level of self-treatment might exacerbate your digestive discomfort or allow the infection to worsen. For a confirmed infection, professional diagnosis is necessary to ensure you get the right treatment without risking kidney damage or other serious complications.",
