      "content": "well i'm not really on any other meds right now so there shouldn't be an issue there. i just really want to avoid the doctor if i can. if i start taking the oregano oil and cranberry right now and i don't see any fever or anything, is it okay to just assume it's working and hold off on the doctor for like a week? i'm sure my body can handle it if it's just a minor thing.",
